					"nextDialogs": [
						706750102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Shuyun"
				},
				{
					"id": 706750102,
					"content": "Your friends won't have to travel long distances to get here. Moreover, the room makes it convenient for anyone to stay for a duel, regardless of who they are.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706750103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Shuyun"
				},
				{
					"id": 706750103,
					"content": "Huh? What do you mean, \"there's no way a cat can accomplish such an impossible feat\"? Hmph, you still have a lot to learn about Prince.",
